1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,775
Dante: Fun fact. In every movie, the smart
ones split up.

2
00:00:04,095 --> 00:00:09,176
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part nine of ten: the split.

3
00:00:09,496 --> 00:00:11,977
Priya: Dante. Those are the ones who die
first.

4
00:00:12,297 --> 00:00:17,797
Dante: More ground. More options. More...
me.

5
00:00:17,917 --> 00:00:20,484
Priya: More people alone. In the dark.

6
00:00:20,804 --> 00:00:22,424
Dante: ...Okay. Buddy system.

7
00:00:22,744 --> 00:00:25,764
Rosa: Fork Road. Left or right? Nobody
knows.

8
00:00:26,084 --> 00:00:28,664
Dante: Lena. You go left. I go right.

9
00:00:28,784 --> 00:00:29,339
Lena: No.

10
00:00:29,659 --> 00:00:33,233
Lena: Dante. You're alone. And somebody's
behind you.

11
00:00:33,353 --> 00:00:34,368
Dante: ...Is it Steve?

12
00:00:34,688 --> 00:00:36,156
Teddy: Gary says friends are a safety
feature.

13
00:00:36,476 --> 00:00:40,103
Priya: Real rule. Stay in pairs. Nobody
goes alone.

14
00:00:40,423 --> 00:00:43,159
Steve: Excuse me. Can I join your pair?

15
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:45,111
Rosa: You're already in the group, Steve.

16
00:00:45,431 --> 00:00:47,392
Dante: I was alone for ten seconds.

17
00:00:47,712 --> 00:00:49,314
Teddy: Gary counted. It felt longer.

18
00:00:49,634 --> 00:00:54,030
BUS-E: Safe Zone twelve. The gate is open.
Welcome home. Cozy!

19
00:00:54,350 --> 00:01:01,214
BUS-E: Part nine of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the dark. Follow for part ten.

